description:
Hello Friends, Sethan is a small village, about 13 km from Manali. It is Peaceful as well as adventurous. Known for its peaceful vibes, snowy landscapes and Buddhist culture, Sethan is a perfect offbeat destination for nature lovers, trekkers, and anyone looking to escape the crowd. Whether you're here for snowboarding in winter or lush green hikes in summer, Sethan promises raw, untouched beauty and soul-soothing silence. 
So , Let's go and join us in exploring this Hidden valley IGLOO VILLAGE OF INDIA - SETHAN VALLEY..

